Subject: [PATCH 02/14] =?UTF-8?q?win81-port:=20=E5=9E=AB=20policy-test-aut?=
 =?UTF-8?q?h=20=E7=9A=84=20Session.fetch=EF=BC=88Electron=2025+=20API?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EF=BC=89?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Electron 22 无 Session.fetch；改用 undici 全局 fetch + 从登录 Session
读取 Cookie 注入请求头，保持 credentials:'include' 与 redirect:'error' 语义。
---
 apps/desktop/src/policy-test-auth.ts | 9 ++++++++-
 1 file changed, 8 insertions(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/apps/desktop/src/policy-test-auth.ts b/apps/desktop/src/policy-test-auth.ts
index e7597a5..8a3ece5 100644
--- a/apps/desktop/src/policy-test-auth.ts
+++ b/apps/desktop/src/policy-test-auth.ts
@@ -58,7 +58,14 @@ export class DesktopPolicyTestAuth {
       || url.username !== '' || url.password !== '') {
       return Promise.reject(new Error('desktop policy: disallowed authenticated request'))
     }
-    return this.browserSession.fetch(url.href, { ...init, credentials: 'include', redirect: 'error', cache: 'no-store' })
+    // [win81-port] Session.fetch 仅存在于 Electron 25+；Electron 22 上改用 undici 全局
+    // fetch 并手动携带登录 Session 的 Cookie（等价 credentials:'include' 语义）。
+    return this.browserSession.cookies.get({ url: url.href }).then((cookies) => {
+      const headers = new Headers(init?.headers)
+      const cookieHeader = cookies.map((cookie) => `${cookie.name}=${cookie.value}`).join('; ')
+      if (cookieHeader !== '') headers.set('cookie', cookieHeader)
+      return globalThis.fetch(url.href, { ...init, headers, redirect: 'error', cache: 'no-store' } as RequestInit)
+    })
   }
 
   /**
